Subject: [PATCH] wave: expose qualified receive and HE feature contracts

Keep the native sniffer interface receive-only: drop netdev TX once, reject
its typed RAW submission before publication and keep the channel TX fence.
Retain native management traffic and the complete receive/recovery owners.

Leave unqualified HE STBC directions unadvertised and unnegotiated. Reject
forced STBC modes before firmware/cache mutation, and reject unsupported
local STBC/DCM/ER beacon bits without changing ordinary peer HE or AP SU-BF.

